                      data-regular-amount>$199*</span></s><span class="rv-sale-price"><strong
                      class="service-price-current" id="service-sale-17"><span class="sr-only">Sale price
                      </span><span data-sale-amount>$159</span>*</strong><span
                      class="grand-opening-mini">Grand<br>Opening</span></span></span>
              </div>

              <div class="offering-price">
